DoxieOS is a local-first operating layer for AI-assisted engineering work.
It includes the DoxieOS product shell, orchestration runtime, documentation,
and first-party Doxie catalog patterns developed by Viamus and contributors.

If you redistribute DoxieOS or a derivative work, keep this NOTICE file or an
equivalent readable attribution notice with the redistributed source,
documentation, package, or generated third-party notices surface.

Local dictation uses OpenAI Whisper Tiny (MIT), with ONNX model exports from
the Hugging Face ONNX Community and the Apache-2.0 Transformers.js runtime.
Model revision and file digests are recorded in src/desktop/dictation-model.json.
